# Okabe-Ito color scheme
# color-blind safe
# from Okabe and Ito's color universal design palette
# Source: Okabe, M. & Ito, K. — "Color Universal Design (CUD)"
# Reference: https://jfly.uni-koeln.de/color/
# Note: Bang Wong popularized this palette in his 2011 Nature Methods column https://doi.org/10.1038/nmeth.1618

# Set color cycle
axes.prop_cycle : cycler('color', ['E69F00', '56B4E9', '009E73', 'F0E442', '0072B2', 'D55E00', 'CC79A7', '000000'])
